  {
    "type": "post",
    "title": "\"Nobody has complained\" is not evidence. People struggle, abandon and find workarounds without ever telling you. \"Our competitors do it\" tells you what competitors do, not whether ",
    "company": "",
    "location": "",
    "text": "\"Nobody has complained\" is not evidence. People struggle, abandon and find workarounds without ever telling you. \"Our competitors do it\" tells you what competitors do, not whether it works for your users. \"We tested it internally\" means your team looked, not every user, device and real-world behaviour. The fake evidence detector is inside the kit, with the grid to score what you are actually basing Q4 on.",
